    <item>
      <title><![CDATA[Your images and links stay where they are]]></title>
      <link>https://wordpress.example/keep-your-wordpress/</link>
      <dc:creator><![CDATA[editor]]></dc:creator>
      <content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>This trial keeps using your original WordPress site. Images load from their existing addresses, and links in your writing keep pointing to the same pages.</p><h2>One conversation</h2><p>For posts with comments open, the comment area connects to WordPress. New comments are saved there and follow your existing moderation rules.</p><blockquote><p>Keep WordPress online while you try ZeroPress.</p></blockquote><p>The included sample posts have comments closed. Your own export determines which posts accept comments.</p>]]></content:encoded>
      <excerpt:encoded><![CDATA[Keep your media and conversations on the original WordPress site.]]></excerpt:encoded>
      <wp:post_id>102</wp:post_id>
      <wp:post_date><![CDATA[2026-09-19 09:00:00]]></wp:post_date>
